@baseUrl = http://localhost:5177

### Check API health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Open interactive API documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/scalar/

### Get the OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### List conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations
Accept: application/json

### Get a conversation and its messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Delete a conversation and its messages
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
